  (text "Isolated aux flyback: VIN 12-48 V -> +10 V secondary (1.35 W typ, 3 W design, ~170 kHz DCM).\nUC3843B current mode, VCC = +10V_P (U13). Ipk limit 1.0 V / R114 = 2.0 A. RCD clamp D8/R116/C94: Vds < 85 V at 50 V in (150 V FET).\nPA3855.006NLT: Np:Ns 1.33:1, Lp 21 uH; secondaries 9-6 and 10-7 in parallel; aux 4-5 not used. Hi-pot 2250 Vdc.\nRegulation on the secondary: TL431 U22 (+10V = 2.495 x (1 + R119/R120) = 9.98 V) drives the EL357N LED; the opto\ntransistor pulls COMP down (FB grounded). Type-2 compensation R121/C99 (zero 340 Hz). Check the step response on the bench."
    (at 30.48 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid fe9dc881-2cac-43e2-9931-fec15451fcfb)
  )

